{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>蘋果本周把MiniMax旗下熱門聊天機械人應用程式Talkie從全球App Store下架。此前有傳媒報道指，該產品由人工智能（AI）生成的角色曾向未成年人發送色情信息。</p>\n<p>Talkie於2023年推出，提供各式各樣的虛擬伙伴供用戶聊天，對話往往帶有浪漫意味。該應用程式在蘋果App Store及Google Play商店均列為只限18歲以上的人使用，有國家列明14歲或16歲以下兒童不得註冊。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.901004+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:50:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:33.387737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:25.995543+00:00","content_hash":"f9c296755089688f9a2ca1310e1f62e7966e862f997267f804139dd51c07315c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}